You can pacify the guards by stealing any item from a shopkeeper then
paying him off, or with a spell of charm monster.  Also, if you choose
to kill them, you should use the "slow monster" spell on them, and
kill them with ranged attacks (i.e. magic missile and thrown daggers).
 Teleport yourself away if you get badly hurt or surrounded.

